  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "orange",
      "title": "Two worker profiles",
      "items": [
        "I/O worker: beside the rclone sidecar and provider credentials; dequeues scan, stage, classify-llm, transfer-small, transfer-large, verify and maintenance",
        "CPU worker: decodes untrusted bytes with read-only staging access; dequeues fingerprint and classify-cheap",
        "Queue limits are per worker; provider-facing queues are partitioned by provider with a shared rate limit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Exactly-once ledger writes",
      "items": [
        "Arrows labelled tx are ledger datasource transactions (run_tx_step_async): the row and its tracking record commit together",
        "classify_remote reserves spend, calls OpenRouter in a step, settles spend and records the decision, each write its own transaction",
        "Provider calls, staging I/O and reads a workflow branches on are DBOS steps; make lint runs workflow_audit against raw database calls in workflows"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Deterministic workflow IDs",
      "items": [
        "ingest:<source>:<version> \u00b7 classify:sha256:<digest> \u00b7 placement:sha256:<digest>:<destination id>@<locator hash>#<attempt>",
        "A repeated enqueue collapses, so reconcile can enqueue every missing placement on every pass",
        "Scan and reconcile hand over to continuation workflows after a bounded batch"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Failure routes",
      "items": [
        "Staging full or transfer not admitted: durable sleep and retry, then recorded failed",
        "Staged entry evicted before fingerprinting: restaged at most twice",
        "Credentials rejected: connection flagged for re-authentication",
        "Spend cap reached: content held; the daily classification-holds pass hands it back next period",
        "Digest mismatch: placement UNTRUSTED; source changed since fingerprinting: placement FAILED and the source re-ingested; failed copy: next reconcile starts a new attempt"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Persisted schedules (maintenance queue)",
      "items": [
        "connections-refresh, scan-all, full-rescan-all, classification-holds, group-events, reconcile, check-destinations, prune-workflow-history, recovery-sweep",
